{
  "scene_id": "006_the_first_coming",
  "description": ".BOOK: 01_garden_genisis",
  "entities": [],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 13,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Analysis,\"",
        "line": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 16,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Primary Dominion designation confirmed,\"",
        "line": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 25,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Indigenous capability assessment,\"",
        "line": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 35,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Threat level?\"",
        "line": 48
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 37,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Minimal. The stone-entities possess significant physical strength and apparent vrill-conductivity, but lack coordinated military structure. The luminescent forms show sophisticated consciousness-crafting abilities but minimal defensive applications. Neither species demonstrates awareness of our presence. Recommended containment protocols: standard biological management with optional selective harvesting for vrill-extraction purposes.\"",
        "line": 51
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 41,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Deployment authorization,\"",
        "line": 57
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Acknowledged. Dispatching Overseer Council for ground coordination. Initiating manufacturing protocol authorization. Preparing Igigi transport vessels and Reptilian genesis facilities.\"",
        "line": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 46,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Standard protocol: monitor, assess, contain if interference occurs. Harvest if vrill-extraction becomes necessary. Eliminate only if direct threat to construction objectives is confirmed.\"",
        "line": 65
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 47,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Efficient,\"",
        "line": 67
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Foundation assessment,\"",
        "line": 98
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 73,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Bedrock stable to depth of four hundred meters. Vrill-flow optimal for energy extraction. Geological composition compatible with Reptilian genesis requirements. No indigenous presence within fifty kilometers. Atmospheric composition within acceptable parameters for extended Igigi habitation.\"",
        "line": 104
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 74,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Commence Phase One construction,\"",
        "line": 106
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 92,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Status report to Citadel command,\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Calculations will not change our trajectory,\"",
        "line": 170
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 121,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Calculations are all we have,\"",
        "line": 173
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 132,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can see it,\"",
        "line": 188
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 140,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Do you think they'll fight?\"",
        "line": 199
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 141,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The mathematics suggest they lack the capability,\"",
        "line": 201
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 173,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Cognitive assessment,\"",
        "line": 247
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 180,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Command structure integration,\"",
        "line": 256
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 189,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Deploy first generation to security positions,\"",
        "line": 269
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 217,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"She's beautiful,\"",
        "line": 308
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 218,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Naming feels like hope,\"",
        "line": 310
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 219,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Hope is all we have.\"",
        "line": 312
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 225,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They're preparing work assignments,\"",
        "line": 321
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 227,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What will they have us build?\"",
        "line": 324
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 228,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Something that will break this world,\"",
        "line": 326
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 235,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Will they fight?\"",
        "line": 335
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 236,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mathematics suggests they will resist. Whether that resistance proves sufficient...\"",
        "line": 337
      }
    }
  ],
